function chirp(freq=440,duration=.07,type:OscillatorType='sine'){if(!soundOn)return;try{audio??=new AudioContext();if(audio.state==='suspended')void audio.resume();const o=audio.createOscillator(),g=audio.createGain();o.type=type;o.frequency.value=freq;g.gain.setValueAtTime(.045,audio.currentTime);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,audio.currentTime+duration);o.connect(g);g.connect(audio.destination);o.start();o.stop(audio.currentTime+duration);}catch{}}
function soundCue(kind:'step'|'blocked'|'collect'|'shard'|'teleport'|'switch'|'rotate'|'win'|'lift'|'attach'|'gloves'|'belt'|'gate'|'bridge'){const cues:Record<typeof kind,{f:number;d:number;t:OscillatorType}[]>={step:[{f:320,d:.045,t:'sine'}],blocked:[{f:185,d:.07,t:'square'}],collect:[{f:620,d:.09,t:'triangle'},{f:830,d:.12,t:'triangle'}],shard:[{f:660,d:.08,t:'sine'},{f:880,d:.09,t:'sine'},{f:1120,d:.14,t:'triangle'}],teleport:[{f:460,d:.08,t:'sine'},{f:760,d:.13,t:'sine'}],switch:[{f:kind==='switch'?680:440,d:.06,t:'triangle'},{f:kind==='switch'?360:520,d:.08,t:'triangle'}],rotate:[{f:500,d:.055,t:'triangle'},{f:640,d:.07,t:'triangle'}],win:[{f:660,d:.12,t:'triangle'},{f:880,d:.14,t:'triangle'},{f:1100,d:.2,t:'sine'}],lift:[{f:520,d:.07,t:'sine'},{f:700,d:.12,t:'sine'}],attach:[{f:420,d:.05,t:'sine'},{f:600,d:.08,t:'triangle'}],gloves:[{f:540,d:.06,t:'triangle'},{f:720,d:.08,t:'triangle'},{f:920,d:.12,t:'sine'}],belt:[{f:260,d:.07,t:'square'},{f:390,d:.08,t:'triangle'},{f:620,d:.12,t:'triangle'}],gate:[{f:180,d:.12,t:'sawtooth'},{f:280,d:.15,t:'triangle'}],bridge:[{f:220,d:.1,t:'square'},{f:330,d:.13,t:'triangle'}]};if(!soundOn)return;cues[kind].forEach((note,index)=>window.setTimeout(()=>chirp(note.f,note.d,note.t),index*45));}
function clearGroup(g:THREE.Group){while(g.children.length){const c=g.children[g.children.length-1];g.remove(c);c.traverse((o:THREE.Object3D)=>{const renderable=o as THREE.Mesh|THREE.Line;if('geometry' in renderable&&renderable.geometry)renderable.geometry.dispose();if('material' in renderable&&renderable.material){const list=Array.isArray(renderable.material)?renderable.material:[renderable.material];for(const m of list)if(!Object.values(materials).includes(m as THREE.MeshToonMaterial))m.dispose();}})}}
